      "content": "It makes sense that maintaining the mask feels impossible when the pain is this deep, but please know your death would be a tragedy because you matter far more than you can see right now. Reaching out to a medical professional or a crisis counselor can help you find relief from this crushing weight and regain a sense of connection to your own life. You are not dead to them; you are simply hurting enough that it feels like the truth has been erased by fear and sadness.",
